<title>SINGAPORE: Hongkong Land wins Singapore site.</title>
<headline>Hongkong Land wins Singapore site.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hongkong Land Holdings Ltd has been awarded a commercial site in downtown Singapore with its highest bid of Singapore $292 million, said the Urban Redevelopment Authority on Monday.  </p>
<p>The URA statement said the 8,783 sq metre site can be used for commercial and or residential development.</p>
<p>The authority also said two residential sites were awarded. The first was to City Developments Ltd for S$118.8 million and another went to Allgreen Properties Ltd for S$40.3 million.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
